        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Finance define the cost-allocation/chargeback rule (by headcount, by shift-served, or by site P&amp;L) and post allocations monthly (inter-entity where BuildRight entities are served — coordinate VS-72)
Responsible (R): Finance / GL (VS-17.1)
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4246_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4246_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
