Responsible (R): Finance FP&amp;A / Site Mgrs
Accountable (A): CFO / COO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4246_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4246_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
