      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual EX review (VS-103.2); attrition spike; feedback cycle
Frequency: Annual + continuous improvement
Volume: Enterprise commute-EX program linked to attrition/attendance analytics
Owner: HR-EX / Employee Experience (VS-103.2) / Transport Lead
Participants: EX (VS-103.2), People Analytics (VS-103.3), OpEx (VS-133), Labor Relations (VS-84)
Source: workflow W4248 — Commute Experience, EVP Linkage &amp; Continuous-Improvement Plan</bpmn:documentation>
