      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4248_Start3" name="Annual EX review (VS-103.2); attrition spike; feedback cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4248_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4248_Task4" name="EX/Analytics run the commute-experience survey and correlate commute difficulty…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: EX/Analytics run the commute-experience survey and correlate commute difficulty with attrition, absenteeism, and engagement (VS-103.2/VS-103.3), prioritizing high-risk sites/shifts
Responsible (R): EX / People Analytics
Accountable (A): Head of HR Shared Services
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4248_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4248_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4248_Task5" name="EX link commute to the Employer Value Proposition / total-rewards narrative…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: EX link commute to the Employer Value Proposition / total-rewards narrative (VS-121 employer brand, VS-102 total rewards) and the attrition/attendance narrative with COO
Responsible (R): EX / Comp / Transport Lead
Accountable (A): CHRO / COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4248_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4248_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4248_Task6" name="EX/OpEx run a continuous-improvement loop on transport (route/timing/comfort…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: EX/OpEx run a continuous-improvement loop on transport (route/timing/comfort changes per W4263/W4264), track EX uplift, and re-baseline
Responsible (R): EX / OpEx (VS-133)
Accountable (A): Head of HR Shared Services
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4248_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4248_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4248_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4248_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
